  "_context_note": "Phase 21. Layers 1/1b/severity are plain phrase matching, which fires on the presence of a phrase regardless of whether the patient is denying it, describing someone else, describing the past, or asking a hypothetical question. These marker lists let the gate look at the clause around a match before trusting it. They can only SUPPRESS a match, never add one -- context-awareness narrows false positives, it does not create a new way to detect a real emergency.",
